flowchart LR
  Public[Public users and browser agents] --> Presentation[Public OKF Explorer and map]
  Analysts[Authenticated analysts and agents] --> Gateway[Governed MCP/control gateway]
  Presentation --> Gateway
  Gateway --> Policy[Identity, OPA and workflow control]
  Policy --> Execution[Deterministic geospatial execution]
  Execution --> Providers[OS, ONS, Nomis, LandIS, HMLR]
  Gateway --> Evidence[Evidence and audit plane]
  Execution --> Evidence
